(Northwind Solar - Employee Handbook \(2026 edition\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. About Northwind Solar) Tj T*
(Northwind Solar was founded in 2014 in Boulder, Colorado. The company designs) Tj T*
(and installs rooftop solar systems for homes and small businesses. As of 2026) Tj T*
(Northwind employs 240 people across four offices: Boulder, Denver, Austin and) Tj T*
(Phoenix. Our mission is to make clean energy the cheapest option for every roof.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Working hours) Tj T*
(Core hours are 10:00 to 15:00 local time. Outside core hours, employees may) Tj T*
(schedule their work flexibly. Installation crews work fixed shifts from 07:00) Tj T*
(to 15:30 between April and October, and 08:00 to 16:00 from November to March.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
