(3. Paid time off) Tj T*
(Full-time employees receive 22 days of paid vacation per year, plus 10 public) Tj T*
(holidays. Vacation accrues monthly. Up to 5 unused days can be carried over) Tj T*
(into the next calendar year; any remaining days expire on March 31.) Tj T*
(Employees also receive 8 sick days per year, which do not carry over.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Parental leave) Tj T*
(Primary caregivers receive 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave. Secondary) Tj T*
(caregivers receive 8 weeks. Leave may be taken within 12 months of the birth) Tj T*
(or adoption and can be split into at most two blocks.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
