(5. Safety on installation sites) Tj T*
(Every crew member must complete the 3-day Roof Safety certification before) Tj T*
(their first install, and renew it every 24 months. Harnesses must be worn on) Tj T*
(any roof with a pitch above 4:12. Work stops when sustained wind exceeds) Tj T*
(25 mph or when lightning is detected within 10 miles.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Learning budget) Tj T*
(Each employee has an annual learning budget of 1,500 USD for courses, books) Tj T*
(and conferences. NABCEP certification fees are covered separately and in full.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
